name: Shortcut — gap straights
author: corpus
description: >-
  Shortcut allows Straights to be made with gaps of 1 rank. First-shop straight engine:
  pairs with Four Fingers for 4-card gap straights, Superposition for Ace-straights, and
  the Straight X jokers.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: Shortcut
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: FourFingers
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 45
  - joker: TheOrder
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Superposition
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 25
